OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and bright at first for
OL,6,Fall, but turning increasingly cloudy
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. Outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fthen spread east during the afternoon,
OL,9,Fturning heavy for a time. Becoming
OL,10,Frather windy and gusty too.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA rather cloudy night follows
OL,13,Fwith the rain easing and turning dry
OL,14,Ffor a time. Remaining rather windy,
OL,15,Fkeeping the temperatures from falling
OL,16,Faway.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA rather cloudy day for all
OL,19,Fon Saturday with a little patchy rain
OL,20,Fat times. Winds easing and turning
OL,21,Fdrier towards the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
