OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry but
OL,6,Frather cloudy on Sunday with some
OL,7,Fovernight rain. Rather cloudy on
OL,8,FMonday and Tuesday with some sunny
OL,9,Fspells and lighter winds and turning a
OL,10,Flittle warmer.
